WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.350
Here's to the crazy ones.
敬那些瘋狂的人。

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.250
The misfits. The rebels.
格格不入的人。反叛的人。

3
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.850
The troublemakers. The round pegs in the square holes.
惹麻煩的人。方孔裡的圓釘。

4
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.930
The ones who see things differently.
看事情跟別人不一樣的人。

5
00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:23.650
They're not fond of rules, and they have no respect for the status quo.
他們不喜歡規矩，也不尊重現狀。

6
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:30.550
You can quote them, disagree with them, glorify or vilify them.
你可以引用他們、反對他們、歌頌或詆毀他們。

7
00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:36.400
About the only thing you can't do is ignore them. Because they change things.
唯一不能做的，是忽視他們——因為他們改變事情。

8
00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:41.900
They push the human race forward.
他們推動人類向前。

9
00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:46.500
And while some may see them as the crazy ones, we see…
有人看見瘋子，我們看見——

10
00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:51.520
…genius. Because the people who are crazy enough to think they can change the world,
——天才。因為瘋狂到以為自己可以改變世界的人，

11
00:00:51.550 --> 00:01:00.500
are the ones who do.
才是真正改變了世界的人。
